  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Velocity of wave $\\mathrm{v}=\\mathrm{n} \\lambda$ where $n=$ frequency of wave $\\Rightarrow n=\\frac{v}{\\lambda}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{n}_{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{v}_{2}}{\\lambda_{2}}=\\frac{396}{100 \\times 10^{-2}}=396 \\mathrm{~Hz}$\r\n\r\nno. of beats $=\\mathrm{n}_{1}-\\mathrm{n}_{2}=4$",
